{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/compare/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710...9ff9572f2ed289d8af198f81ce08bdac66d8a69c","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/compare/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710...9ff9572f2ed289d8af198f81ce08bdac66d8a69c","permalink_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/compare/osfans:7f90906...osfans:9ff9572","diff_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/compare/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710...9ff9572f2ed289d8af198f81ce08bdac66d8a69c.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/compare/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710...9ff9572f2ed289d8af198f81ce08bdac66d8a69c.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","node_id":"C_kwDOAivEQNoAKDdmOTA5MDYwYTFkNDIxOThlNzQ5ZWIxZjlhNjYzOTlmNzZiZjg3MTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"X2M7","email":"liang.xumin97@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-23T02:18:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"X2M7","email":"liang.xumin97@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-23T02:18:56Z"},"message":"fix(ime): call TextView setter before invalidating caches\n\nForward every text and buffer type to TextView before invalidating the custom\nmeasurement and transform caches. Drop the content comparison, which cannot\nrepresent buffer conversions or filtering performed by the parent setter.\nKeep constructor-time calls safe by marking caches dirty without reading them.","tree":{"sha":"2da497746bf3997515b816629ae92e6d2ffef0fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/git/trees/2da497746bf3997515b816629ae92e6d2ffef0fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/git/commits/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/commits/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/commit/7f909060a1d42198e749eb1f9a66399f76bf8710","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o